{"video_id": "TfQbCxRLX0c", "channel_id": "UCpVkalcUalZUjmVp0ZxqReg", "fetched_at": "2026-11-24T15:15:12.723731+00:00", "fetch_tool": "yt-dlp 2026.08.19", "caption_track_type": "auto_generated", "segments": [{"start_seconds": 0.3, "end_seconds": 4.2, "text": "Picture this, Zara."}, {"start_seconds": 2.4, "end_seconds": 7.4, "text": "You're in a team meeting."}, {"start_seconds": 4.2, "end_seconds": 9.1, "text": "Your manager turns to you and says,"}, {"start_seconds": 7.4, "end_seconds": 11.1, "text": "Can you give us a quick update on the"}, {"start_seconds": 9.1, "end_seconds": 13.8, "text": "website project?"}, {"start_seconds": 11.1, "end_seconds": 16.2, "text": ">> That's the exact moment where most"}, {"start_seconds": 13.8, "end_seconds": 18.6, "text": "people freeze up, Theo."}, {"start_seconds": 16.2, "end_seconds": 19.6, "text": "You know the project inside and out,"}, {"start_seconds": 18.6, "end_seconds": 21.7, "text": "right?"}, {"start_seconds": 19.6, "end_seconds": 23.8, "text": "It's just finding the right words to"}, {"start_seconds": 21.7, "end_seconds": 26.3, "text": "explain what's going on."}, {"start_seconds": 23.8, "end_seconds": 28.9, "text": "Now, that can be difficult."}, {"start_seconds": 26.3, "end_seconds": 31.3, "text": ">> The good news is there's a simple way to"}, {"start_seconds": 28.9, "end_seconds": 35.0, "text": "structure your update so you can explain"}, {"start_seconds": 31.3, "end_seconds": 37.1, "text": "what's going on clearly and confidently."}, {"start_seconds": 35.0, "end_seconds": 39.6, "text": ">> And although we're saying project"}, {"start_seconds": 37.1, "end_seconds": 42.0, "text": "update, this structure works for all"}, {"start_seconds": 39.6, "end_seconds": 44.7, "text": "kinds of workplace updates."}, {"start_seconds": 42.0, "end_seconds": 46.7, "text": ">> It does. And we'll break it down into"}, {"start_seconds": 44.7, "end_seconds": 48.5, "text": "four parts."}, {"start_seconds": 46.7, "end_seconds": 50.3, "text": "Progress,"}, {"start_seconds": 48.5, "end_seconds": 52.2, "text": "problems,"}, {"start_seconds": 50.3, "end_seconds": 53.9, "text": "recommendations,"}, {"start_seconds": 52.2, "end_seconds": 56.9, "text": "and next steps."}, {"start_seconds": 53.9, "end_seconds": 57.8, "text": ">> Let's start with progress."}, {"start_seconds": 56.9, "end_seconds": 60.0, "text": "So,"}, {"start_seconds": 57.8, "end_seconds": 62.9, "text": "the very first thing your manager wants"}, {"start_seconds": 60.0, "end_seconds": 65.0, "text": "to know is where the project stands"}, {"start_seconds": 62.9, "end_seconds": 68.4, "text": "right now."}, {"start_seconds": 65.0, "end_seconds": 69.8, "text": ">> Exactly. Before discussing any problems"}, {"start_seconds": 68.4, "end_seconds": 71.8, "text": "or delays,"}, {"start_seconds": 69.8, "end_seconds": 73.8, "text": "people usually want a quick picture of"}, {"start_seconds": 71.8, "end_seconds": 75.6, "text": "what's been completed and what's"}, {"start_seconds": 73.8, "end_seconds": 77.1, "text": "currently happening."}, {"start_seconds": 75.6, "end_seconds": 80.0, "text": ">> That's right."}, {"start_seconds": 77.1, "end_seconds": 82.7, "text": "And you'll often find that a good update"}, {"start_seconds": 80.0, "end_seconds": 84.2, "text": "starts with some positive progress."}, {"start_seconds": 82.7, "end_seconds": 86.4, "text": ">> Absolutely."}, {"start_seconds": 84.2, "end_seconds": 88.0, "text": "If things are moving forward, it's good"}, {"start_seconds": 86.4, "end_seconds": 90.9, "text": "to say that early."}, {"start_seconds": 88.0, "end_seconds": 92.4, "text": ">> Let's start with a simple example."}, {"start_seconds": 90.9, "end_seconds": 94.8, "text": "You could say"}, {"start_seconds": 92.4, "end_seconds": 97.1, "text": "the design is finished."}, {"start_seconds": 94.8, "end_seconds": 99.4, "text": ">> And there's nothing wrong with that."}, {"start_seconds": 97.1, "end_seconds": 101.4, "text": "It's clear and people immediately"}, {"start_seconds": 99.4, "end_seconds": 103.9, "text": "understand what you mean."}, {"start_seconds": 101.4, "end_seconds": 106.0, "text": ">> But at work, you'll often hear something"}, {"start_seconds": 103.9, "end_seconds": 107.6, "text": "a little more formal."}, {"start_seconds": 106.0, "end_seconds": 110.6, "text": "For example,"}, {"start_seconds": 107.6, "end_seconds": 112.0, "text": "we've completed the design phase."}, {"start_seconds": 110.6, "end_seconds": 113.7, "text": ">> I like that version."}, {"start_seconds": 112.0, "end_seconds": 115.0, "text": "It sounds more professional."}, {"start_seconds": 113.7, "end_seconds": 116.9, "text": "And it's the kind of language you'll"}, {"start_seconds": 115.0, "end_seconds": 118.5, "text": "hear in meetings."}, {"start_seconds": 116.9, "end_seconds": 119.79, "text": ">> And if you want to sound a little more"}, {"start_seconds": 118.5, "end_seconds": 122.39, "text": "confident,"}, {"start_seconds": 119.79, "end_seconds": 125.49, "text": "don't just talk about what's finished."}, {"start_seconds": 122.39, "end_seconds": 127.09, "text": "Talk about what's happening now as well."}, {"start_seconds": 125.49, "end_seconds": 129.39, "text": "For example,"}, {"start_seconds": 127.09, "end_seconds": 132.29, "text": "we've completed the first phase and"}, {"start_seconds": 129.39, "end_seconds": 134.09, "text": "development is now underway."}, {"start_seconds": 132.29, "end_seconds": 135.89, "text": ">> That's a strong update."}, {"start_seconds": 134.09, "end_seconds": 137.89, "text": "You're giving people a fuller picture of"}, {"start_seconds": 135.89, "end_seconds": 140.09, "text": "the project."}, {"start_seconds": 137.89, "end_seconds": 142.59, "text": "You're showing what's been completed and"}, {"start_seconds": 140.09, "end_seconds": 144.29, "text": "what the team is working on now."}, {"start_seconds": 142.59, "end_seconds": 147.09, "text": ">> And if everything is going according to"}, {"start_seconds": 144.29, "end_seconds": 149.59, "text": "plan, you could add"}, {"start_seconds": 147.09, "end_seconds": 151.79, "text": "we're on track to meet the deadline."}, {"start_seconds": 149.59, "end_seconds": 153.49, "text": ">> That's particularly useful."}, {"start_seconds": 151.79, "end_seconds": 155.59, "text": "It tells your manager that the project"}, {"start_seconds": 153.49, "end_seconds": 157.49, "text": "is progressing well"}, {"start_seconds": 155.59, "end_seconds": 159.79, "text": "and it gives them confidence that you're"}, {"start_seconds": 157.49, "end_seconds": 161.19, "text": "likely to finish on time."}, {"start_seconds": 159.79, "end_seconds": 163.39, "text": ">> Exactly."}, {"start_seconds": 161.19, "end_seconds": 164.69, "text": "Those small updates can make a big"}, {"start_seconds": 163.39, "end_seconds": 166.09, "text": "difference."}, {"start_seconds": 164.69, "end_seconds": 168.09, "text": "People don't have to guess how the"}, {"start_seconds": 166.09, "end_seconds": 169.89, "text": "project is doing. You're telling them"}, {"start_seconds": 168.09, "end_seconds": 172.69, "text": "clearly."}, {"start_seconds": 169.89, "end_seconds": 174.29, "text": ">> Now, let's look at the other side of a"}, {"start_seconds": 172.69, "end_seconds": 177.69, "text": "project update."}, {"start_seconds": 174.29, "end_seconds": 179.99, "text": "Explaining problems or delays."}, {"start_seconds": 177.69, "end_seconds": 182.69, "text": "When something goes wrong, people need"}, {"start_seconds": 179.99, "end_seconds": 184.99, "text": "to understand what happened and what it"}, {"start_seconds": 182.69, "end_seconds": 188.29, "text": "means for the project."}, {"start_seconds": 184.99, "end_seconds": 190.49, "text": ">> And remember, problems come up. That's"}, {"start_seconds": 188.29, "end_seconds": 192.79, "text": "completely normal."}, {"start_seconds": 190.49, "end_seconds": 194.89, "text": "The important thing is to be clear about"}, {"start_seconds": 192.79, "end_seconds": 196.49, "text": "what's happening and what you're doing"}, {"start_seconds": 194.89, "end_seconds": 198.89, "text": "about it."}, {"start_seconds": 196.49, "end_seconds": 200.49, "text": ">> Let's start with the basic version."}, {"start_seconds": 198.89, "end_seconds": 201.89, "text": "You could say"}, {"start_seconds": 200.49, "end_seconds": 203.29, "text": "we're late."}, {"start_seconds": 201.89, "end_seconds": 205.59, "text": ">> It's clear,"}, {"start_seconds": 203.29, "end_seconds": 207.09, "text": "but in a business setting, it can sound"}, {"start_seconds": 205.59, "end_seconds": 209.89, "text": "a little blunt."}, {"start_seconds": 207.09, "end_seconds": 212.49, "text": "A more professional option would be"}, {"start_seconds": 209.89, "end_seconds": 214.59, "text": "we're running behind schedule."}, {"start_seconds": 212.49, "end_seconds": 215.99, "text": ">> That sounds much smoother and more"}, {"start_seconds": 214.59, "end_seconds": 218.39, "text": "natural."}, {"start_seconds": 215.99, "end_seconds": 220.29, "text": "And if you want to sound more confident,"}, {"start_seconds": 218.39, "end_seconds": 222.79, "text": "you could say"}, {"start_seconds": 220.29, "end_seconds": 224.39, "text": "we've experienced a slight delay,"}, {"start_seconds": 222.79, "end_seconds": 226.89, "text": "but we're taking steps to get the"}, {"start_seconds": 224.39, "end_seconds": 228.99, "text": "project back on track."}, {"start_seconds": 226.89, "end_seconds": 231.39, "text": ">> I like that one because it doesn't just"}, {"start_seconds": 228.99, "end_seconds": 233.19, "text": "describe the problem, it shows that"}, {"start_seconds": 231.39, "end_seconds": 234.89, "text": "action is being taken."}, {"start_seconds": 233.19, "end_seconds": 236.99, "text": ">> It does."}, {"start_seconds": 234.89, "end_seconds": 238.29, "text": "You can also explain the cause of the"}, {"start_seconds": 236.99, "end_seconds": 239.89, "text": "issue."}, {"start_seconds": 238.29, "end_seconds": 242.09, "text": "For example,"}, {"start_seconds": 239.89, "end_seconds": 244.89, "text": "the The challenge we're facing is that"}, {"start_seconds": 242.09, "end_seconds": 247.69, "text": "we're waiting for final client approval."}, {"start_seconds": 244.89, "end_seconds": 250.89, "text": ">> And after explaining the cause,"}, {"start_seconds": 247.69, "end_seconds": 252.89, "text": "it's helpful to explain the impact."}, {"start_seconds": 250.89, "end_seconds": 255.79, "text": "So you might say,"}, {"start_seconds": 252.89, "end_seconds": 257.09, "text": "this could delay the testing schedule."}, {"start_seconds": 255.79, "end_seconds": 259.39, "text": ">> Right."}, {"start_seconds": 257.09, "end_seconds": 261.19, "text": "Now people can see how that delay could"}, {"start_seconds": 259.39, "end_seconds": 263.89, "text": "affect the project."}, {"start_seconds": 261.19, "end_seconds": 266.69, "text": ">> Yes, because you're not just describing"}, {"start_seconds": 263.89, "end_seconds": 268.39, "text": "what's happening, you're explaining why"}, {"start_seconds": 266.69, "end_seconds": 270.99, "text": "it matters."}, {"start_seconds": 268.39, "end_seconds": 273.39, "text": "So we've explained the problem, what's"}, {"start_seconds": 270.99, "end_seconds": 274.69, "text": "causing it, and how it could affect the"}, {"start_seconds": 273.39, "end_seconds": 276.89, "text": "project."}, {"start_seconds": 274.69, "end_seconds": 278.69, "text": "The next step is to recommend a"}, {"start_seconds": 276.89, "end_seconds": 280.19, "text": "solution."}, {"start_seconds": 278.69, "end_seconds": 281.89, "text": ">> People don't just want to hear what's"}, {"start_seconds": 280.19, "end_seconds": 285.09, "text": "wrong."}, {"start_seconds": 281.89, "end_seconds": 286.49, "text": "They want to know what you recommend."}, {"start_seconds": 285.09, "end_seconds": 288.19, "text": ">> Right."}, {"start_seconds": 286.49, "end_seconds": 290.69, "text": "Managers usually want to hear your"}, {"start_seconds": 288.19, "end_seconds": 292.99, "text": "thinking too."}, {"start_seconds": 290.69, "end_seconds": 295.79, "text": "What do you suggest?"}, {"start_seconds": 292.99, "end_seconds": 297.89, "text": "What's the best way forward?"}, {"start_seconds": 295.79, "end_seconds": 299.29, "text": ">> Let's go back to our website project"}, {"start_seconds": 297.89, "end_seconds": 302.29, "text": "example."}, {"start_seconds": 299.29, "end_seconds": 304.89, "text": "We're waiting for final client approval."}, {"start_seconds": 302.29, "end_seconds": 307.29, "text": "And that's causing a delay."}, {"start_seconds": 304.89, "end_seconds": 309.99, "text": "So when making a recommendation,"}, {"start_seconds": 307.29, "end_seconds": 312.39, "text": "the basic version could be"}, {"start_seconds": 309.99, "end_seconds": 313.69, "text": "we can ask the client again."}, {"start_seconds": 312.39, "end_seconds": 316.29, "text": ">> That works."}, {"start_seconds": 313.69, "end_seconds": 319.39, "text": "People will understand what you mean."}, {"start_seconds": 316.29, "end_seconds": 321.79, "text": "A more professional option would be"}, {"start_seconds": 319.39, "end_seconds": 323.99, "text": "we could follow up with the client."}, {"start_seconds": 321.79, "end_seconds": 325.69, "text": ">> I like that one. It sounds more"}, {"start_seconds": 323.99, "end_seconds": 328.09, "text": "business-like."}, {"start_seconds": 325.69, "end_seconds": 329.49, "text": "And if you want to sound more confident,"}, {"start_seconds": 328.09, "end_seconds": 331.49, "text": "you could say,"}, {"start_seconds": 329.49, "end_seconds": 332.99, "text": "my recommendation would be to contact"}, {"start_seconds": 331.49, "end_seconds": 335.99, "text": "the client today"}, {"start_seconds": 332.99, "end_seconds": 338.09, "text": "and ask them to confirm by Wednesday."}, {"start_seconds": 335.99, "end_seconds": 340.69, "text": ">> That's a strong example."}, {"start_seconds": 338.09, "end_seconds": 342.99, "text": "It's specific and it gives everyone a"}, {"start_seconds": 340.69, "end_seconds": 345.59, "text": "clear next step."}, {"start_seconds": 342.99, "end_seconds": 348.19, "text": "You're not just suggesting an action,"}, {"start_seconds": 345.59, "end_seconds": 351.09, "text": "you're also giving a deadline."}, {"start_seconds": 348.19, "end_seconds": 353.59, "text": ">> And that's important. A recommendation"}, {"start_seconds": 351.09, "end_seconds": 357.09, "text": "should help people decide what to do"}, {"start_seconds": 353.59, "end_seconds": 358.99, "text": "next. The clearer it is, the easier it"}, {"start_seconds": 357.09, "end_seconds": 361.19, "text": "is to take action."}, {"start_seconds": 358.99, "end_seconds": 363.89, "text": ">> Managers don't expect you to solve every"}, {"start_seconds": 361.19, "end_seconds": 366.69, "text": "problem immediately, but they do want to"}, {"start_seconds": 363.89, "end_seconds": 369.8, "text": "see that you're thinking ahead."}, {"start_seconds": 366.69, "end_seconds": 371.3, "text": "So don' just describe the problem."}, {"start_seconds": 369.8, "end_seconds": 374.3, "text": "Whenever possible,"}, {"start_seconds": 371.3, "end_seconds": 378.19, "text": "suggest a way forward as well."}, {"start_seconds": 374.3, "end_seconds": 381.3, "text": ">> And finally, we come to the fourth part,"}, {"start_seconds": 378.19, "end_seconds": 382.69, "text": "explaining the next steps."}, {"start_seconds": 381.3, "end_seconds": 385.3, "text": ">> Right."}, {"start_seconds": 382.69, "end_seconds": 386.89, "text": "Once you've explained the progress, any"}, {"start_seconds": 385.3, "end_seconds": 389.0, "text": "problems,"}, {"start_seconds": 386.89, "end_seconds": 391.19, "text": "and your recommendations,"}, {"start_seconds": 389.0, "end_seconds": 393.3, "text": "it's important to make it clear what"}, {"start_seconds": 391.19, "end_seconds": 395.3, "text": "happens next,"}, {"start_seconds": 393.3, "end_seconds": 397.5, "text": "who's responsible,"}, {"start_seconds": 395.3, "end_seconds": 399.3, "text": "what needs to be done,"}, {"start_seconds": 397.5, "end_seconds": 400.89, "text": "and when will it happen."}, {"start_seconds": 399.3, "end_seconds": 402.5, "text": ">> Exactly."}, {"start_seconds": 400.89, "end_seconds": 404.09, "text": "This is the part that gives people"}, {"start_seconds": 402.5, "end_seconds": 406.19, "text": "clarity."}, {"start_seconds": 404.1, "end_seconds": 408.9, "text": ">> And it helps everyone understand what to"}, {"start_seconds": 406.19, "end_seconds": 411.39, "text": "expect after the meeting."}, {"start_seconds": 408.89, "end_seconds": 413.09, "text": ">> Let's start with a basic example."}, {"start_seconds": 411.39, "end_seconds": 415.19, "text": "You could say,"}, {"start_seconds": 413.1, "end_seconds": 416.7, "text": "I'll email the client."}, {"start_seconds": 415.19, "end_seconds": 419.5, "text": ">> That's clear."}, {"start_seconds": 416.69, "end_seconds": 421.59, "text": "People know what you're going to do."}, {"start_seconds": 419.5, "end_seconds": 423.3, "text": "But you can make it stronger by adding"}, {"start_seconds": 421.6, "end_seconds": 426.3, "text": "more detail."}, {"start_seconds": 423.3, "end_seconds": 429.1, "text": "A more professional version would be,"}, {"start_seconds": 426.3, "end_seconds": 430.6, "text": "I'll follow up with the client today."}, {"start_seconds": 429.1, "end_seconds": 433.4, "text": ">> I like that one."}, {"start_seconds": 430.6, "end_seconds": 435.6, "text": "Now we've added a timeline."}, {"start_seconds": 433.39, "end_seconds": 437.09, "text": "And if you want to sound even more"}, {"start_seconds": 435.6, "end_seconds": 438.9, "text": "confident,"}, {"start_seconds": 437.1, "end_seconds": 441.5, "text": "you could say,"}, {"start_seconds": 438.89, "end_seconds": 445.29, "text": "I'll follow up with the client today"}, {"start_seconds": 441.5, "end_seconds": 447.8, "text": "and share a revised timeline by Friday."}, {"start_seconds": 445.3, "end_seconds": 449.69, "text": ">> That's a strong update."}, {"start_seconds": 447.8, "end_seconds": 450.8, "text": "Your manager knows what you 're going to"}, {"start_seconds": 449.69, "end_seconds": 452.5, "text": "do"}, {"start_seconds": 450.8, "end_seconds": 453.9, "text": "and when they can expect the next"}, {"start_seconds": 452.5, "end_seconds": 456.39, "text": "update."}, {"start_seconds": 453.89, "end_seconds": 457.89, "text": "There's much less uncertainty."}, {"start_seconds": 456.39, "end_seconds": 459.79, "text": ">> Exactly."}, {"start_seconds": 457.89, "end_seconds": 460.89, "text": "And that's often what people are looking"}, {"start_seconds": 459.8, "end_seconds": 462.6, "text": "for."}, {"start_seconds": 460.89, "end_seconds": 464.79, "text": "Not perfection,"}, {"start_seconds": 462.6, "end_seconds": 466.4, "text": "just clarity."}, {"start_seconds": 464.8, "end_seconds": 468.6, "text": "It's also important to make"}, {"start_seconds": 466.39, "end_seconds": 470.09, "text": "responsibilities clear,"}, {"start_seconds": 468.6, "end_seconds": 471.9, "text": "especially when several people are"}, {"start_seconds": 470.1, "end_seconds": 473.7, "text": "involved."}, {"start_seconds": 471.89, "end_seconds": 475.59, "text": ">> That's a good point."}, {"start_seconds": 473.69, "end_seconds": 477.3, "text": "Sometimes you're not just reporting on"}, {"start_seconds": 475.6, "end_seconds": 479.4, "text": "your own work."}, {"start_seconds": 477.3, "end_seconds": 481.9, "text": "You might also need to update people on"}, {"start_seconds": 479.39, "end_seconds": 484.19, "text": "what other team members are doing."}, {"start_seconds": 481.89, "end_seconds": 486.69, "text": "So you could say,"}, {"start_seconds": 484.19, "end_seconds": 488.8, "text": "James is following up with the client,"}, {"start_seconds": 486.69, "end_seconds": 490.2, "text": "and Natasha is updating the project"}, {"start_seconds": 488.8, "end_seconds": 492.4, "text": "timeline."}, {"start_seconds": 490.2, "end_seconds": 494.6, "text": ">> Everyone knows who's responsible for"}, {"start_seconds": 492.4, "end_seconds": 496.5, "text": "each task."}, {"start_seconds": 494.6, "end_seconds": 498.9, "text": "And everyone understands what needs to"}, {"start_seconds": 496.5, "end_seconds": 501.5, "text": "happen next."}, {"start_seconds": 498.9, "end_seconds": 503.8, "text": ">> when you're giving a project update,"}, {"start_seconds": 501.5, "end_seconds": 506.1, "text": "don't stop at the problem."}, {"start_seconds": 503.8, "end_seconds": 508.6, "text": "Explain the next steps,"}, {"start_seconds": 506.1, "end_seconds": 510.2, "text": "make responsibilities clear,"}, {"start_seconds": 508.6, "end_seconds": 511.9, "text": "and let people know when they'll hear"}, {"start_seconds": 510.2, "end_seconds": 515.0, "text": "from you again."}, {"start_seconds": 511.9, "end_seconds": 517.7, "text": ">> That's what makes an update useful."}, {"start_seconds": 515.0, "end_seconds": 519.7, "text": ">> So far, we've looked at each part of the"}, {"start_seconds": 517.7, "end_seconds": 524.0, "text": "update on its own."}, {"start_seconds": 519.7, "end_seconds": 526.0, "text": "Progress, problems, recommendations,"}, {"start_seconds": 524.0, "end_seconds": 528.2, "text": "and next steps."}, {"start_seconds": 526.0, "end_seconds": 530.9, "text": "Now, let's hear what it sounds like when"}, {"start_seconds": 528.2, "end_seconds": 532.1, "text": "we put everything together."}, {"start_seconds": 530.9, "end_seconds": 533.6, "text": ">> Okay."}, {"start_seconds": 532.1, "end_seconds": 535.3, "text": "Here's how that might sound in a"}, {"start_seconds": 533.6, "end_seconds": 537.9, "text": "meeting."}, {"start_seconds": 535.3, "end_seconds": 541.0, "text": "We 've completed the design phase, and"}, {"start_seconds": 537.9, "end_seconds": 543.0, "text": "development is now underway."}, {"start_seconds": 541.0, "end_seconds": 546.0, "text": "The main challenge we're facing is that"}, {"start_seconds": 543.0, "end_seconds": 549.8, "text": "we're waiting for final client approval,"}, {"start_seconds": 546.0, "end_seconds": 551.9, "text": "which could affect the testing schedule."}, {"start_seconds": 549.8, "end_seconds": 554.7, "text": "My recommendation would be to contact"}, {"start_seconds": 551.9, "end_seconds": 556.9, "text": "the client today and ask for feedback by"}, {"start_seconds": 554.7, "end_seconds": 559.0, "text": "Wednesday."}, {"start_seconds": 556.9, "end_seconds": 562.7, "text": "Once we receive their response, I'll"}, {"start_seconds": 559.0, "end_seconds": 565.5, "text": "share a revised timeline by Friday."}, {"start_seconds": 562.7, "end_seconds": 568.0, "text": ">> That sounds clear and professional."}, {"start_seconds": 565.5, "end_seconds": 569.6, "text": "Notice that it flows naturally from one"}, {"start_seconds": 568.0, "end_seconds": 572.3, "text": "point to the next."}, {"start_seconds": 569.6, "end_seconds": 573.8, "text": "Nothing feels disconnected."}, {"start_seconds": 572.3, "end_seconds": 576.2, "text": ">> So, the next time you're asked for a"}, {"start_seconds": 573.8, "end_seconds": 577.9, "text": "project update, remember these four"}, {"start_seconds": 576.2, "end_seconds": 580.0, "text": "parts."}, {"start_seconds": 577.9, "end_seconds": 582.1, "text": "Progress,"}, {"start_seconds": 580.0, "end_seconds": 584.2, "text": "problem,"}, {"start_seconds": 582.1, "end_seconds": 586.1, "text": "recommendation,"}, {"start_seconds": 584.2, "end_seconds": 588.6, "text": "next steps."}, {"start_seconds": 586.1, "end_seconds": 590.8, "text": ">> So, that's a structure you can use for"}, {"start_seconds": 588.6, "end_seconds": 593.1, "text": "all kinds of updates."}, {"start_seconds": 590.8, "end_seconds": 595.6, "text": "Not just project updates."}, {"start_seconds": 593.1, "end_seconds": 598.7, "text": ">> And the more you use it, the easier"}, {"start_seconds": 595.6, "end_seconds": 600.6, "text": "those updates become."}, {"start_seconds": 598.7, "end_seconds": 603.2, "text": ">> It definitely makes those update"}, {"start_seconds": 600.6, "end_seconds": 605.6, "text": "meetings a lot less stressful."}, {"start_seconds": 603.2, "end_seconds": 607.5, "text": ">> Now, before we go, thanks so much for"}, {"start_seconds": 605.6, "end_seconds": 609.7, "text": "spending some time with us today."}, {"start_seconds": 607.5, "end_seconds": 612.6, "text": ">> And if you're new to English Shift, we'd"}, {"start_seconds": 609.7, "end_seconds": 614.5, "text": "love to have you with us. So, subscribe"}, {"start_seconds": 612.6, "end_seconds": 616.1, "text": "if you'd like more practical workplace"}, {"start_seconds": 614.5, "end_seconds": 618.7, "text": "English like this."}, {"start_seconds": 616.1, "end_seconds": 621.0, "text": ">> One quick question before you go."}, {"start_seconds": 618.7, "end_seconds": 622.3, "text": "Which part of a project update do you"}, {"start_seconds": 621.0, "end_seconds": 624.2, "text": "find hardest?"}, {"start_seconds": 622.3, "end_seconds": 625.5, "text": ">> Let us know in the comments."}, {"start_seconds": 624.2, "end_seconds": 626.7, "text": ">> Thanks again."}, {"start_seconds": 625.5, "end_seconds": 627.9, "text": ">> We'll see you next time."}, {"start_seconds": 626.7, "end_seconds": 630.2, "text": ">> Bye everyone."}, {"start_seconds": 627.9, "end_seconds": 630.2, "text": ">> Bye."}]}